@baseUrl = http://localhost:5131

### Get all suppliers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/suppliers

### Get one supplier
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/suppliers/3

### Create a supplier
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Name": "Albert Heijn Barendrecht",
  "Address": "Kruispunt 1",
  "City": "Barendrecht",
  "ZipCode": "2991KK",
  "Province": "Zuid-Holland",
  "Country": "Netherlands",
  "ContactName": "Jan Pieter",
  "PhoneNumber": "1111111111",
  "Reference": "Coca Cola"
}

### Delete a supplier
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/suppliers/4